    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Unlike the Sparse Block Row, the <ref refid="class_arg_min_1_1_block_vector" kindref="compound">BlockVector</ref> is assumed to be dense and can then achieve constant time insert, lookup, and erase via the slot map. This class uses a slightly different variant of the slot map. One which allows us to choose a key value pair. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
